# Kconfig for the NOTCH_LAB Buildroot external tree.
#
# This tree ships only defconfigs (configs/) and rootfs overlays (board/),
# no custom packages, so there are no menu entries to source here.
# The file must exist for Buildroot to accept BR2_EXTERNAL; leave it empty
# until a package/ dir is added, then `source` each package's Config.in below.
